 "words": 185,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Old Samuel came to Bethlehem with a horn of oil in hand",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesse lined up all his sons, the finest in the land",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eliab stood the tallest, he looked every inch a king",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the LORD said, not this one, I'm looking at a different thing",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD does not see as man sees",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Man looks at the outward appearance",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the LORD looks at the heart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD looks at the heart",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven sons went walking by, and seven times God said no",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Are these all the young men you have, the prophet asked him slow",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There is still the youngest, he is out tending the sheep",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Send for him, we will not sit down, this promise God will keep",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD does not see as man sees",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Man looks at the outward appearance",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the LORD looks at the heart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD looks at the heart",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Rise and anoint him, this is the one",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The shepherd boy with the dust of the hills",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And from that day on the Spirit of the LORD",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Came powerfully upon David",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD looks at the heart",
